{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0d665e0b0bb08932","name":"Trooper Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-0d665e0b0bb08932","title":"Trooper Talent Tree","revision":20075,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:09:35Z","sha256":"82099055e29f0e8690d3ec8aa71e22ffc41c5189ebf2e86aa17ae2fa1b5ef6c1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20075","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Trooper%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0d665e0b0bb08932","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In war, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"}," stand side by side against deadly foes, and you have learned how to keep yourself and your comrades alive in battle.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Comrades in Arms"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are within 3 squares of an ally, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," rolls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Focused Targeting"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Comrades in Arms"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you damage a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Phalanx"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Watch Your Back"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you provide \"soft\" ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," to an ally within 3 squares, you are considered to be providing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Cover"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stick Together"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Comrades in Arms"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally moves you can immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},", provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Watch Your Back"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you are adjacent to at least one ally, enemies gain no benefit from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flanking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flanking"}," you or any adjacent allies.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
